  "result": "Perfect! All 172 tests pass. The voucher feature is complete.\n\n**What was implemented:**\n- Added `applyVoucher(invoice, { code, amount })` to src/invoices.js that applies a fixed amount voucher to draft invoices\n- Voucher takes a fixed amount in cents off the invoice total (after VAT)\n- Errors:\n  - NOT_DRAFT if invoice isn't a draft\n  - VOUCHER_EXISTS if invoice already has a voucher\n  - AMOUNT_INVALID if amount isn't a positive integer\n- Updated `invoiceTotals()` to include voucher field and calculate: total = subtotal - discount + vat - voucher\n- Added VOUCHER_EXISTS error code to src/errors.js\n\n**Test coverage includes:**\n- Basic voucher application to draft invoices\n- Rejection of vouchers on non-draft invoices\n- Prevention of multiple vouchers on same invoice\n- Amount validation (positive integer only)\n- No mutation of original invoice\n- invoiceTotals returns voucher amount correctly\n- Total calculation with voucher deduction\n- Clamping of total to 0 with large vouchers\n- Integration with existing discounts and VAT\n\nAll 172 tests pass.",
